{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_PDUR_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_PDURouter","page":26,"text":"6 Requirements Tracing\nThe following table reference the requirements specified in [3] and [4] and links to the\nfulfillment of these. Please note that if column “Satisfied by” is empty for a specific\nrequirement this means that this requirement is not fulfilled by this document.\nRequirement\nDescription\nSatisfied by\n[SRS_BSW_00003]\nAll software modules shall provide\nversion and identification information\n[SWS_PduR_00762]\n[SRS_BSW_00101]\nThe Basic Software Module shall be\nable to initialize variables and\nhardware in a separate initialization\nfunction\n[SWS_PduR_00334]\n[SRS_BSW_00301]\nAll AUTOSAR Basic Software\nModules shall only import the\nnecessary information\n[SWS_PduR_00333]\n[SRS_BSW_00305]\nData types naming convention\n[SWS_PduR_00654] [SWS_PduR_00742]\n[SWS_PduR_00743] [SWS_PduR_00771]\n[SRS_BSW_00310]\nAPI naming convention\n[SWS_PduR_00334] [SWS_PduR_00338]\n[SWS_PduR_00341] [SWS_PduR_00362]\n[SWS_PduR_00365] [SWS_PduR_00369]\n[SWS_PduR_00375] [SWS_PduR_00381]\n[SWS_PduR_00406] [SWS_PduR_00504]\n[SWS_PduR_00507] [SWS_PduR_00512]\n[SWS_PduR_00518] [SWS_PduR_00615]\n[SWS_PduR_00617] [SWS_PduR_00767]\n[SWS_PduR_00769] [SWS_PduR_00800]\n[SRS_BSW_00323]\nAll AUTOSAR Basic Software\nModules shall check passed API\nparameters for validity\n[SWS_PduR_00100] [SWS_PduR_00221]\n[SWS_PduR_00647] [SWS_PduR_00648]\n[SWS_PduR_00649] [SWS_PduR_00716]\n[SRS_BSW_00335]\nStatus values naming convention\n[SWS_PduR_00742]\n[SRS_BSW_00337]\nClassification of development errors\n[SWS_PduR_00100]\n[SRS_BSW_00350]\nAll AUTOSAR Basic Software\nModules shall allow the enabling/\ndisabling of detection and reporting of\ndevelopment errors.\n[SWS_PduR_00802]\n[SRS_BSW_00358]\nThe return type of init() functions\nimplemented by AUTOSAR Basic\nSoftware Modules shall be void\n[SWS_PduR_00334]\n[SRS_BSW_00369]\nAll AUTOSAR Basic Software\nModules shall not return specific\ndevelopment error codes via the API\n[SWS_PduR_00119] [SWS_PduR_00221]\n[SWS_PduR_00648] [SWS_PduR_00649]\n[SWS_PduR_00663] [SWS_PduR_00670]\n[SWS_PduR_00807] [SWS_PduR…","caption":"6 Requirements Tracing","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_PDUR_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R23-11"],"page":28,"hash":"2b3d4518207a98f9","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/bfe52ea523a4/page_28.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_PDUR_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R24-11"],"page":26,"hash":"24c5682fbef667c8","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/3f97e95f6b36/page_26.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_PDUR_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R25-11"],"page":30,"hash":"9dfea117ca684c6c","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/d9982814ff4f/page_30.webp"}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/d9982814ff4f/page_30.webp","trel":"R25-11","tstat":"section","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_PduR_00334 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_PDURouter.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_PduR_00334"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_PduR_00338 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_PDURouter.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_PduR_00338"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_PduR_00341 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_PDURouter.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_PduR_00341"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_PduR_00615 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_PDURouter.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_PduR_00615"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE"